    {
      "id": "claim_4a934d99741146c9aa772be9fcf24765",
      "statement": "RaindropService.saveToRaindrop calls raindropApiClient.createBookmark(...) and, only after it returns successfully, calls ArticleEngagementStore.recordQuietly(article.getId(), EngagementKind.RAINDROP) before logging success; this engagement-recording call is made directly in RaindropService, outside the circuit-breaker/retry-annotated RaindropApiClientImpl bean, so a failed or blocked save never records an engagement row.",
